{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-tracing-gateway","title":"分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/distributed-tracing-gateway","wordCount":617,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式链路追踪-网关如何成为追踪的起点\">分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Trace</strong></td>\n<td>一个完整请求的端到端链路，由多个 Span 组成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Span</strong></td>\n<td>链路中的一段操作（如&quot;网关处理&quot;、&quot;调用订单服务&quot;）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Trace ID</strong></td>\n<td>唯一标识一条链路，在所有 Span 间传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Parent Span ID</strong></td>\n<td>指向父 Span，构成树状调用结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>采样率</strong></td>\n<td>只对部分请求生成完整 Trace，控制存储开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OpenTelemetry</strong></td>\n<td>追踪、指标、日志的统一标准（CNCF 项目）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网关是链路追踪的天然起点\">网关是链路追踪的天然起点</h2><p>每个进入系统的请求在网关层创建&quot;根 Span&quot;，并将 Trace 上下文（Trace ID + Span ID）注入到转发给后端的请求 Header 中。后端服务从 Header 中读取上下文，创建子 Span，形成完整的调用链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    C[客户端] --&gt; GW[API Gateway: Span A Root]&#10;    GW --&gt;|注入 traceparent| US[用户服务: Span B]&#10;    GW --&gt;|注入 traceparent| OS[订单服务: Span C]&#10;    OS --&gt; IS[库存服务: Span D]&#10;    OS --&gt; PS[支付服务: Span E]\">graph TB\n    C[客户端] --&gt; GW[API Gateway: Span A Root]\n    GW --&gt;|注入 traceparent| US[用户服务: Span B]\n    GW --&gt;|注入 traceparent| OS[订单服务: Span C]\n    OS --&gt; IS[库存服务: Span D]\n    OS --&gt; PS[支付服务: Span E]</pre><h2 id=\"传播格式标准\">传播格式标准</h2><p>Trace 上下文通过 HTTP Header 在服务间传播，主要有两个标准：</p>\n<h3 id=\"w3c-trace-context-推荐\">W3C Trace Context（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01&#10;             版本  TraceID(32位hex)            ParentSpanID(16位) 采样标志&#10;&#10;tracestate: vendor-specific-data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             版本  TraceID(32位hex)            ParentSpanID(16位) 采样标志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracestate: vendor-specific-data</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"b3-zipkin-向后兼容\">B3（Zipkin，向后兼容）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"X-B3-TraceId: 4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736&#10;X-B3-SpanId: 00f067aa0ba902b7&#10;X-B3-ParentSpanId: 0000000000000001&#10;X-B3-Sampled: 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>X-B3-TraceId: 4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-B3-SpanId: 00f067aa0ba902b7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-B3-ParentSpanId: 0000000000000001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-B3-Sampled: 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OpenTelemetry 默认使用 W3C Trace Context，新系统推荐选择该标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在网关实现追踪注入\">在网关实现追踪注入</h2><h3 id=\"kong-配置-使用-opentelemetry-插件\">Kong 配置（使用 OpenTelemetry 插件）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kong OpenTelemetry 插件&#10;plugins:&#10;  - name: opentelemetry&#10;    config:&#10;      endpoint: &#39;http://otel-collector:4317&#39; # gRPC OTLP Endpoint&#10;      resource_attributes:&#10;        service.name: &#39;api-gateway&#39;&#10;        service.version: &#39;2.1.0&#39;&#10;      sampling_rate: 0.1 # 采样 10%&#10;      batch_span_processor:&#10;        max_export_batch_size: 512&#10;        scheduled_delay_millis: 5000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kong OpenTelemetry 插件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opentelemetry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://otel-collector:4317'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # gRPC OTLP Endpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resource_attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        service.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api-gateway'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        service.version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      sampling_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 采样 10%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      batch_span_processor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        max_export_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        scheduled_delay_millis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"envoy-配置\">Envoy 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"tracing:&#10;  http:&#10;    name: envoy.tracers.opentelemetry&#10;    typed_config:&#10;      &#39;@type&#39;: type.googleapis.com/envoy.config.trace.v3.OpenTelemetryConfig&#10;      grpc_service:&#10;        envoy_grpc:&#10;          cluster_name: otel_collector&#10;      service_name: &#39;api-gateway&#39;&#10;&#10;# HTTP 过滤器链中的追踪配置&#10;http_filters:&#10;  - name: envoy.filters.http.router&#10;    typed_config:&#10;      start_child_span: true # 为每个路由创建子 Span\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tracing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">envoy.tracers.opentelemetry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typed_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type.googleapis.com/envoy.config.trace.v3.OpenTelemetryConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc_service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        envoy_grpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cluster_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel_collector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api-gateway'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># HTTP 过滤器链中的追踪配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">http_filters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">envoy.filters.http.router</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typed_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      start_child_span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 为每个路由创建子 Span</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义-span-属性\">自定义 Span 属性</h3><p>网关应在根 Span 上记录关键属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 使用 OpenTelemetry Go SDK&#10;func (gw *Gateway) traceRequest(ctx context.Context, req *Request) (context.Context, trace.Span) {&#10;    tracer := otel.Tracer(&quot;api-gateway&quot;)&#10;&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, req.Route,&#10;        trace.WithSpanKind(trace.SpanKindServer),&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            semconv.HTTPMethodKey.String(req.Method),&#10;            semconv.HTTPURLKey.String(req.URL),&#10;            semconv.HTTPRouteKey.String(req.RouteName),&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;gateway.consumer&quot;, req.ConsumerID),&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;gateway.upstream&quot;, req.Upstream),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    return ctx, span&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (gw *Gateway) finishSpan(span trace.Span, resp *Response, err error) {&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        span.RecordError(err)&#10;        span.SetStatus(codes.Error, err.Error())&#10;    } else {&#10;        span.SetAttributes(&#10;            semconv.HTTPStatusCodeKey.Int(resp.StatusCode),&#10;            attribute.Int64(&quot;gateway.latency_ms&quot;, resp.LatencyMS),&#10;            attribute.Bool(&quot;gateway.cache_hit&quot;, resp.CacheHit),&#10;            attribute.Int(&quot;gateway.retry_count&quot;, resp.RetryCount),&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;    span.End()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 OpenTelemetry Go SDK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Gateway</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">traceRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"api-gateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.Route,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithSpanKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trace.SpanKindServer),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.HTTPMethodKey.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.Method),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.HTTPURLKey.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.URL),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.HTTPRouteKey.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.RouteName),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gateway.consumer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, req.ConsumerID),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gateway.upstream\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, req.Upstream),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx, span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Gateway</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">finishSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RecordError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(codes.Error, err.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semconv.HTTPStatusCodeKey.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resp.StatusCode),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gateway.latency_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resp.LatencyMS),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gateway.cache_hit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resp.CacheHit),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gateway.retry_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, resp.RetryCount),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"采样策略\">采样策略</h2><p>生产系统不能对所有请求生成完整 Trace（存储和性能开销太大），需要合理采样：</p>\n<h3 id=\"头部采样-head-based-sampling\">头部采样（Head-Based Sampling）</h3><p>在链路起点（网关）决定是否采样，决定后一直传播：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 尾部采样（Tail-Based）是在收到所有 Span 后决定，通常在 Collector 做&#10;// 头部采样（Head-Based）在请求进入时就决定，实现简单&#10;&#10;sampler := sdktrace.ParentBased(&#10;    sdktrace.TraceIDRatioBased(0.1), // 10% 采样&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 尾部采样（Tail-Based）是在收到所有 Span 后决定，通常在 Collector 做</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 头部采样（Head-Based）在请求进入时就决定，实现简单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sdktrace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ParentBased</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sdktrace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TraceIDRatioBased</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10% 采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自适应采样-adaptive-sampling\">自适应采样（Adaptive Sampling）</h3><p>对低流量路由提高采样率（确保足够样本），对高流量路由降低采样率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func adaptiveSamplingRate(route string, qps float64) float64 {&#10;    if qps &lt; 10 {&#10;        return 1.0   // 低流量：100% 采样&#10;    }&#10;    if qps &lt; 1000 {&#10;        return 0.1   // 中流量：10% 采样&#10;    }&#10;    return 0.01      // 高流量：1% 采样&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> adaptiveSamplingRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">route</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 低流量：100% 采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 中流量：10% 采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 高流量：1% 采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于标志强制采样\">基于标志强制采样</h3><p>调试时，用 Header 强制某个请求被采样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"X-Debug-Trace: force-sample&#10;&#10;# 网关检测到这个 Header → 忽略采样策略，强制生成完整 Trace\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>X-Debug-Trace: force-sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 网关检测到这个 Header → 忽略采样策略，强制生成完整 Trace</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"从-trace-到快速定位问题\">从 Trace 到快速定位问题</h2><p>完整的追踪链可以让你快速回答：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"问题：某个 POST /api/orders 请求耗时 3 秒&#10;Trace 显示:&#10;  - Span A（网关）: 0-3000ms&#10;    - Span B（订单服务）: 50-2900ms&#10;      - Span C（库存服务 RPC）: 60-2800ms  ← 2740ms，这里是瓶颈&#10;        - Span D（DB 查询）: 70-2790ms    ← 2720ms，SQL 慢查询\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>问题：某个 POST /api/orders 请求耗时 3 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Trace 显示:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - Span A（网关）: 0-3000ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Span B（订单服务）: 50-2900ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      - Span C（库存服务 RPC）: 60-2800ms  ← 2740ms，这里是瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        - Span D（DB 查询）: 70-2790ms    ← 2720ms，SQL 慢查询</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Trace 把&quot;某个请求慢了&quot;精确定位到&quot;哪个服务的哪个操作慢了&quot;，是排查性能问题不可替代的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关是链路追踪的天然起点，负责创建根 Span 并将 Trace 上下文（Trace ID）注入到下游请求 Header 中。推荐使用 W3C Trace Context 标准和 OpenTelemetry SDK，与 Jaeger/Tempo 等后端集成。采样策略要在可见性与存储成本间权衡：低流量路由高采样、高流量路由低采样；支持通过 Header 强制采样用于调试。监控体系结合<a href=\"gateway-logging-metrics\">网关日志与指标</a>一起使用，构建完整的可观测性能力。API 生命周期管理见下一篇<a href=\"api-versioning-lifecycle\">API 版本管理与生命周期</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点","id":"分布式链路追踪-网关如何成为追踪的起点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网关是链路追踪的天然起点","id":"网关是链路追踪的天然起点"},{"level":2,"text":"传播格式标准","id":"传播格式标准"},{"level":3,"text":"W3C Trace Context（推荐）","id":"w3c-trace-context-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"B3（Zipkin，向后兼容）","id":"b3-zipkin-向后兼容"},{"level":2,"text":"在网关实现追踪注入","id":"在网关实现追踪注入"},{"level":3,"text":"Kong 配置（使用 OpenTelemetry 插件）","id":"kong-配置-使用-opentelemetry-插件"},{"level":3,"text":"Envoy 配置","id":"envoy-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义 Span 属性","id":"自定义-span-属性"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略","id":"采样策略"},{"level":3,"text":"头部采样（Head-Based Sampling）","id":"头部采样-head-based-sampling"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应采样（Adaptive Sampling）","id":"自适应采样-adaptive-sampling"},{"level":3,"text":"基于标志强制采样","id":"基于标志强制采样"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Trace 到快速定位问题","id":"从-trace-到快速定位问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/gateway-logging-metrics"},"next":{"title":"API 版本管理与生命周期：如何优雅地演进 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/api-versioning-lifecycle"}}